+# Publication integration order — 2026-09-03
+
+This file freezes the required order before any new external publication effect is claimed.
+
+```text
+#964 proof-status material
+        \
+corrected #962 source + Zenodo/arXiv packages
+          \
+#965 ledger, classifier and normalized receipt contracts
+            \
+2026-09-03 evidence-spiral/fixed-point integration
+              |
+              v
+one reviewed and validated integration head
+              |
+              v
+legitimate promotion to one exact Trusted Main SHA
+              |
+              v
+fresh reobservation of that exact Main SHA
+              |
+              +-- Wikipedia transparent request -> authoritative readback
+              +-- Zenodo publish -> public record/DOI/file-hash readback
+              +-- arXiv authenticated submit -> submission/status readback
+                                            -> later public-ID/version readback
+```
+
+## Gate
+
+The external adapters MUST NOT be treated as satisfied from candidate-branch evidence. The integration head must first be reviewed and validated, legitimately promoted, and freshly reobserved on the exact resulting Trusted Main SHA.
+
+## Current integration addition
+
+The new material that must exist before the publication chain continues consists of:
+
+- the evidence-spiral construction: local fixed point plus monotone successor evidence;
+- the preexisting QIK-VRT fixed-point artifact binding and its empirical boundary;
+- the finite binary representation theorem and its ontological boundary;
+- the low-energy observational quotient as a proposed organizing synthesis;
+- bilingual scientific notes;
+- a machine-readable claim matrix and integration-state contract.
+
+No line in this document constitutes an external publication receipt.
